===Strategy===
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Ch.1 is much similar to its non-outbreak appearances, with Bore being the main threat. Due to the length of the stage and 10 deployment restriction, it is often best to lure the Bore out to your base before gunning it down with anti-Red attackers paired with tanky units like [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] or red CC units like [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]].

While the stage is supported by beefier peons, they aren't much of an issue—they give you significant money to deal with Bore.

